---
id: KelolaJenisDokumen-UbahJenisDokumen
title: Kelola Jenis Dokumen - Ubah Jenis Dokumen
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR/Super Admin
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant C as DocumentTypeController
    participant DT as DocumentType Model
    participant DB as Database

    HR->>UI: Klik tombol Edit pada jenis dokumen tertentu
    UI->>C: GET /admin/document-types/{id}
    C->>DT: Find document type
    DT->>DB: SELECT * FROM document_types WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>DT: Document type data
    DT-->>C: DocumentType instance
    C-->>UI: Response dengan data
    UI->>UI: Tampilkan form dengan data terpre-fill
    HR->>UI: Ubah data dan klik Simpan
    UI->>C: PUT /admin/document-types/{id}
    note over C: Validasi: nama unik (exclude current), kode unik (exclude current)
    alt Validasi berhasil
        C->>DT: Update document type
        DT->>DB: UPDATE document_types SET name = ?, code = ?, description = ?, is_required = ?, updated_at = NOW() WHERE id = ?
        DB-->>DT: Jenis dokumen berhasil diperbarui
        DT-->>C: Updated instance
        C-->>UI: Response sukses
        UI-->>HR: Notifikasi perubahan berhasil
    else Validasi gagal
        C-->>UI: Response error
        UI-->>HR: Tampilkan pesan error
    end

